- [#&#8203;17894](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17894) [`b7a1bd9`](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/commit/b7a1bd99ac7c68cf36078058f15f1bd1fab4cbe8) Thanks [@&#8203;Princesseuh](https://redirect.github.com/Princesseuh)! - Adds a new `--timings` flag to `astro build` to help you find what slows down your builds

